    "check": "all fourteen names and votes read on the page image of the Newry Telegraph, 20 May 1961, p. 8 (results list and 'How they fared' table); poll 78.3 per cent (493 of 628).",
    "url": "https://www.britishnewspaperarchive.co.uk/viewer/bl/0000999/19610520/034/0008"
